Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand up tall, reach out your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.84,0:00:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut through the wind and make a stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.08,0:00:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The paint within brings\Nout a map of your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.14,0:00:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,To the left and the right,\Nall we saw stormy nights.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.82,0:00:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,All the rough winds and\Nwaves coming day after day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.16,0:00:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,And the values we had\Nwere about to collapse.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.36,0:00:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, just where do we go next?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.86,0:00:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And as we look down to the compass in\Nhand Is it showing us the right direction?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.74,0:00:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,All we know is nobody\Nhere knows it for certain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.70,0:00:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,So close your eyes and breathe in deeply.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.02,0:00:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,And listen to your soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.30,0:00:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll see a path in front of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.20,0:00:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,And you'll know just where you need to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.62,0:00:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,So stand up tall, reach out your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.92,0:00:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut through the wind and make us stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.12,0:01:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let the darkness\Nwin. Just break through.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.62,0:01:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do it my own way,\Nthat's what's best for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.22,0:01:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And you do it your way,\Nthat's how it's got to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.86,0:01:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We're moving forward. Now I'm ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.46,0:01:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But at times it's okay\Nto get help on the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.30,0:01:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,For the future ahead, burning bright.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.84,0:01:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,For what's ahead you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.28,0:01:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Is beyond your wildest dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.60,0:01:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,So stand up tall, reach out your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.84,0:01:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut through the wind and make a stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.06,0:01:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let the darkness\Nwin. Just break through.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.42,0:01:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll do it our way.\NThe best that we know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.18,0:01:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,With tears and doubts and tone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.64,0:01:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll go where we all wanna go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.00,0:01:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The page within brings colors of our own.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.44,0:02:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you doing this, you traitor?\NBecause it's what I believe is right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.42,0:02:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I envy you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.30,0:02:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Finger pistol.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.74,0:02:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you write down your wish yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.08,0:02:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to light up the skyboats!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.54,0:02:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Wowie!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.54,0:03:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, let's fly it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.16,0:03:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like it's time to send\Nyour wish to the heavens.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.86,0:03:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You ready, Daddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.90,0:03:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,All right. Now come, come!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.12,0:04:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,He's bending the earth of his attacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.48,0:04:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that carnivish from the palace?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.22,0:04:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,How is that possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.52,0:04:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't show mercy! Fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.72,0:04:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see how you handle this!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.56,0:04:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't believe me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.08,0:04:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.99,0:04:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you're so close!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.64,0:04:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not the only one who can\Npredict people's attacks, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.14,0:04:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll even copy your technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.40,0:04:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.82,0:05:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.08,0:05:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He ate me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.68,0:05:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.68,0:05:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I said let me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.58,0:05:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Blast! Breath!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.56,0:06:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Form a Bounce Man!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.36,0:06:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That scaly bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.20,0:06:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,He's feeding the crap out of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.38,0:06:22.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta turn this around!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.90,0:06:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You're coming back for more, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.28,0:06:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gotta be running\Nout of steam after that!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.40,0:06:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Once fourth gear wears off, I'm done for!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.90,0:06:51.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm running out of time to finish him off!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.64,0:07:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, fourth gear, don't fail me now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.00,0:07:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Not again!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.64,0:07:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Never thought those rubber powers of\Nyours would give me so much trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.76,0:07:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like you're about done, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.30,0:07:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.52,0:07:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Never done!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.86,0:07:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's enjoy the finale, Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.32,0:07:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.04,0:07:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I said I'm not here to have fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.42,0:07:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here to beat you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.82,0:07:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I've seen what you've done to Wano.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.38,0:07:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,They can't even find water to drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.78,0:07:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Or enough food to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.28,0:07:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Not as long as you're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.80,0:07:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,They have nothing, because\Nthey lost the battle to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.58,0:08:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You should thank me for\Nletting them keep their lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.64,0:08:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Side with who you like, but\Nthe people of Wano are losers.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.92,0:08:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Worse yet, they've grown\Naccustomed to being losers.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.78,0:08:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The weak bow down and the
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.00,0:08:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,honorable die over and over.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.20,0:08:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I've watched them make pathetic\Nexcuses for their failures.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.10,0:08:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.06,0:08:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You have no idea how\Nstrong the samurai are.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.44,0:08:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Are they strong or are they acting strong?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.60,0:08:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,True strength doesn't require praise.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.66,0:08:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It speaks for itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.28,0:08:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you the real thing
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.56,0:08:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,or not? It's time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.78,0:08:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.24,0:08:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,No, go. No!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.32,0:08:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Overcome
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.90,0:08:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Dying!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.28,0:09:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Not.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.58,0:09:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Done.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.49,0:09:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.82,0:09:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta make sure he's down for good!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.10,0:09:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh dear, it's gonna run\Nout on me any second now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.74,0:09:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Thunder Meadow!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.60,0:09:51.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Barbara!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.56,0:10:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.58,0:10:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,One shot. It's time to\Nfinish up the story. I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.98,0:10:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,betting everything i've got\Non this All right, Brat,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.68,0:11:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,show me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.14,0:11:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Win or lose, this is the end!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.56,0:11:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna fail this one!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.04,0:11:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,C. P. Zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.72,0:11:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is he here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.58,0:12:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.98,0:13:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know. I
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.08,0:13:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,don't
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.40,0:13:43.23,Default,,0,0,0,,know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.98,0:14:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.60,0:14:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy's voice is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.28,0:14:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The battle on the rooftop\Nhas come to an end.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.80,0:14:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The winner, Kaido, King of the Beasts.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.72,0:14:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know what you've done?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.28,0:15:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.00,0:15:32.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Kawamatsu!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.91,0:15:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The ceiling's gonna collapse!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.58,0:15:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to evacuate now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.52,0:15:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I cannot flee when thousands of our\Ncomrades are still in the castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.42,0:15:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to make it home together, but\Nwe're too high up to reach the seawater!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.70,0:15:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there nothing we can\Ndo to stop this fire?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.98,0:16:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, run to safety!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.12,0:16:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no honor in burning to death!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.14,0:16:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Last breath?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.02,0:16:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, is that...?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.16,0:16:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaido.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.74,0:16:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is your leader?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.66,0:16:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring Odin's son to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.46,0:16:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time for Momonosuke\Nto announce his surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.52,0:16:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.90,0:16:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What did he just say?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.92,0:17:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat's voice went\Nsilent, so it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.20,0:17:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems he was no match for an emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.86,0:17:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You're lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.86,0:17:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to be lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.58,0:17:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucy would never, he would never.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.54,0:17:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Lucy is dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.34,0:17:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,If any of you still have the\Ncourage to defy me and step up,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.60,0:17:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't had my fill of\Nviolence for the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.12,0:17:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Still hang out with a silver\Nskin in the commander Tino's way!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.22,0:17:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back, big bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.88,0:17:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't die now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.72,0:17:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You just can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.66,0:17:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, stop! Are you crazy?\NI won't let him keep lying?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.86,0:18:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Who does that snake think he's fooling?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.06,0:18:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a liar and i won't\Nlet him get away with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.92,0:18:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You say Luffy's dead? You think\Nwe'll just believe you're stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.22,0:18:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,lies and give up?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.44,0:18:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,When Luffy says he'll win,\Nhe'll do it no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.54,0:18:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,He will never
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.98,0:18:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,lose, do you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.46,0:18:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,And he will not die.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.08,0:18:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,He can't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.02,0:18:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.14,0:18:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, now that's
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.84,0:18:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,,more like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.86,0:18:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,At least one of you\Nhas some guts. Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.00,0:18:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Since you don't seem to understand,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.12,0:18:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Allow me to teach you\Nthe meaning of defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.32,0:18:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Last prayer!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.72,0:18:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.96,0:19:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Bunami, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.48,0:19:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to pull it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.48,0:19:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The battle's not over yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.74,0:19:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.22,0:19:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Or a gushing of the land\Non the flower capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.38,0:19:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And I will take control\Nof the land of Wano.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.14,0:19:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Orochi has been too lenient on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.96,0:19:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll show you true suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.20,0:19:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,This country will be my weapons factory.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.02,0:19:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And all men.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.46,0:19:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Women and children will be my slaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.42,0:19:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,When you're too exhausted\Nto work, roll over and die.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.96,0:19:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Every time we lose a slave,\Nwe'll just replace it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.34,0:20:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,My wrath is the price you\Npay for your defiance.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.56,0:20:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This is what happens\Nwhen you lose a battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.64,0:20:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Your life belongs to the victor.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.98,0:20:14.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Your hopes and dreams are mine\Nto trample, However I please.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.24,0:20:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring Momonosuke here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.42,0:20:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll continue to slaughter\Nuntil that happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.94,0:20:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Your country is finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.64,0:20:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Your children and your children's\Nchildren will sink into despair.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.50,0:20:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That is the cost of your weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.62,0:20:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,No, not my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.74,0:20:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't do this, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.80,0:20:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, look over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.50,0:20:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Kid-in-law are barely alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.02,0:20:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's butcher them while they're down.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.32,0:20:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter if you took out Big Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.88,0:20:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You are never going to be Commander Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.40,0:20:56.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You took your own dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.98,0:20:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you're happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.54,0:21:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Little shits.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.70,0:21:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Protect the captains!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.02,0:21:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what's he doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.56,0:21:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.46,0:21:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.68,0:21:23.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.26,0:21:30.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Everywhere
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.50,0:21:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't there a way out?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.38,0:21:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You still got some fight\Nleft in you, Trafalgar?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.54,0:21:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I'm not going to\Nsit here and wait to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.66,0:21:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, Straw Hats.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.68,0:22:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you gone mad?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.22,0:22:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't possibly win now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.86,0:22:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,How can we hope to succeed\Nwhen even Luffy failed?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.04,0:22:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to live until we die!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.58,0:22:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll put our lives on the\Nline until we breathe our last!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.52,0:22:11.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Just as Samurai should!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.10,0:22:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,If we don't do it, then who else will?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.36,0:22:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Our allies are wounded right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.32,0:22:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,But so is Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.74,0:22:19.21,Default,,0,0,0,,This might be our chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.86,0:22:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Yamato, this is absurd!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.86,0:22:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaido is an emperor of the sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.02,0:22:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We underestimated his strength!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.98,0:22:29.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It's as simple as that!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.92,0:22:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Victory is no longer within our reach.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.34,0:22:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,If we continue to resist, it\Nwill only result in more deaths.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.94,0:22:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We did our best, but it\Nsimply wasn't enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.32,0:22:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I know this is difficult to\Nhear, but Luffy has lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.96,0:22:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We have no choice but to surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.26,0:22:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I will never allow that!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.98,0:22:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't live as a slave!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.92,0:22:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You think there's value in that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.58,0:22:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Living your life in chains waiting to die?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.14,0:22:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't even know that\Nsurrendering will save anyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.46,0:23:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't allow it!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.90,0:23:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll stop you myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.30,0:23:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The daimyo who stood up to\NOrochi died hungry for revenge,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.18,0:23:09.47,Default,,0,0,0,,but they never gave up on this country!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.04,0:23:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We've inherited its future,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.90,0:23:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,and we carry the weight of all the\Ndreams that they couldn't fulfill!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.70,0:23:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.70,0:23:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And even if you and I die here\Ntonight, at least we'll die together!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.08,0:24:09.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.98,0:24:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke, I can hear them.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.06,0:24:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.76,0:24:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Zonesia, what are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.16,0:24:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I can hear the drums of liberation.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.90,0:24:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,For the first time in 800 years!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.82,0:24:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,He is here!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.04,0:24:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.14,0:25:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is here?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.60,0:25:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Joy Boy has returned!
